      <h1>declared-shell-and-shipping</h1>
      <p>A row declaring the shell state for a repository that has published a finished release, which is the disagreement the state is computed to settle</p>
      <p>The plugin has a finished release published, so there is something to install.</p>
      <p>The plugin is built in the repository Fixture/jellyfin-plugin-declared-shell-and-shipping, and what this page says about it is read from the roster rather than written here.</p>
